Notice on derivation from EPANET 2.2

This project is an independent re-implementation of the hydraulic engine of
EPANET 2.2.0 (US EPA / OpenWaterAnalytics). Algorithms, coefficient formulas,
convergence logic and unit-conversion constants were transcribed from the
EPANET 2.2.0 C sources, which are distributed under the MIT License
("Copyright (c) 2017 (see AUTHORS)"; see
https://github.com/USEPA/EPANET2.2, SRC_engines/LICENSE). No EPANET C source
file is redistributed in this repository. MIT was chosen for this project so
that the two licenses are compatible.

The EPA disclaimer that accompanies the EPANET release applies to EPANET
itself, not to this project; this project is not endorsed by the US EPA or by
OpenWaterAnalytics.
